# The repo root is the build context ONLY for the gateway image
# (dockerize/deployment/Dockerfile), which reads just
# src/packages/flutter-app sources, dockerize/deployment/nginx, and
# dockerize/static. Everything below is dead weight in that context.
# (Patterns are root-anchored: the `main`/`travel-route-planner` entries
# above only match at the context root, which is why the api tree needs
# its own entry — and the api image has its own .dockerignore, since its
# context is src/packages/api where this file never applies.)
src/packages/api/
src/packages/flutter-app/build/
src/packages/flutter-app/.dart_tool/
.claude/
